00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:11.990
It doesn't really rewind time. Rather, it bends it.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:16.500
And it's not just time—it also bends other things, like space, and the laws of physics.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:21.250
Archetype should be ordinary matter 
so long as it exists in this world.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.460
Yet it creates miracles?

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:25.550
Could it destroy the world?

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:28.760
It's grander than breaking the law of nature!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.890
It's like the logic of this world doesn't apply to it...

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:37.520
As if it's overflowing with Hell itself, you could say?

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:40.770
It's like this whole universe wouldn't exist anymore.

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:43.130
