00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.100
Th-That hurt...

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:36.200
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:41.420
What is this?

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:43.670
It's warping symmetry!

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:47.070
I understand the mechanism behind the Ashihara Cascade!

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:48.540
Um...

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:50.930
Look at this!

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:52.140
It's not the molecules,

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:58.520
Transform... and fasten.

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:03.820
It's a three-dimensional structure 
undergoing a higher-dimensional transformation!

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:07.610
Care to tag along with me to London this weekend?

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:11.350
My, oh my.

