00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:17.600
Surrender!

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:20.630
Very good! Let's battle!

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:24.070
I see thou art no ordinary foe!

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:26.050
Now, before you have a taste of this punch—

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:27.340
Tail!?

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:29.820
Ow!

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:31.970
That hurt...

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:33.710
You've done it now.

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:36.860
You bastard!

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:38.970
This is nothing!

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.450
What have I done...

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:52.220
Even Homer sometimes nods, 
and even a dragon's claw can fail to strike...

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.240
As I thought, it's driven by curiosity.

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:56.120
Curiosity? So it's a playful kaiju?

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:57.790
Ugh!

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:03.790
Hey, wait—

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:05.920
Wh-What are you doing?

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:07.130
Stop!

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:10.160
This... this has been a long time coming!

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.430
It lost interest.

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:15.150
Talk about a fickle kaiju.

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:17.010
It's coming this way!

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:21.850
The needles are...!

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.690
There are civilians in the mountains behind the robot.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.400
Take care when firing!

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:30.440
Roger!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:31.440
This isn't good.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.700
Hey! Don't shoot!

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.110
It'll deflect your shots straight back at you!

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:50.550
Ricochet!

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:51.800
Stop shooting!

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.760
Let's hurry and head back.

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:03.520
Just as he predicted.

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:06.350
Retreat as fast as possible! Retreat!

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:14.280
How's Jet Jaguar?

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.660
This next one won't miss.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:18.820
What's wrong?

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:22.080
I'll borrow this for a bit!

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:27.040
Sit back and watch!

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:28.790
Alright! I'll leave him to you!

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:43.390
Here we go!

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:49.310
Read the trajectory of bullets all you want...!

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:54.640
I'll give it straight to you.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.230
There!

00:11:56.950 --> 00:12:03.040
You can't dodge if I'm right in your face!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.530
No dice.

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:40.790
To think the monkey could do 
what the calculator could not.

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:44.200
From Professor Li?

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:46.510
A <i>great</i> time to be scolded.

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:51.000
Chemical Reactions in Hyperspace?

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.250
Higher dimensions?

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:54.340
Dad! For dinner...

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.050
Eating on your own again!?

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:58.800
I'm in the middle of something. Wait a second.

00:12:58.800 --> 00:12:59.970
How long?

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:01.970
Tell me it's less than a hundred years.

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:03.600
10,000 years.

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.350
Well, I just won't wait!

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:07.220
Steven.

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:10.640
Li solved the puzzle of Ashihara Cascade.

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:13.920
Wait... This isn't Li?

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:16.110
Kamino? Who are you?

00:13:16.110 --> 00:13:17.990
Kamino Mei.

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:23.030
Sonar detected. 180 degrees. Distance 12,000.

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:26.160
Depth 120. Speed 70 knots.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:28.250
Target group designated as alpha.

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:32.750
Depth 90. It's rapidly rising. Speed remains the same.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:36.750
60... 20... it reached the surface!

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:39.210
Target group's speed is 60 knots.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:41.260
Patrol helicopter is RTB.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:43.890
Target group at 180 degrees.

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:47.260
Distance 8,000. Speed 60 knots.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:48.830
It's rapidly approaching.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.370
Prepare for surface combat!

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:53.770
Surface combat, portside artillery!

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:59.290
CIC! Acquire targets!

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:02.240
Main cannon, fire at will!

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:17.040
Track numbers 2621 to 2627 have sunk.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:20.050
Next, track number 2711.

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:21.050
Will it work?

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:33.390
The target group's path hasn't changed. 
Still approaching.

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:35.520
180 degrees to the left.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.900
The target group is charging right in!

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:39.820
Hard a-starboard!

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:42.530
Halt left turn. Full right!

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.530
180 degrees! Steady!

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:49.340
Main cannon! Cease fire!

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:52.120
All hands, prepare for impact!

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:01.430
The target group is overtaking the ship on both sides.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:03.760
New target!

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:06.140
Left bow. Distance 100.

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:08.890
It's rapidly rising from depth 100.

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:10.390
Its speed is 80 knots.

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:12.060
Distance 30.

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:13.540
Depth 20.

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:14.400
10...

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:15.100
Surfacing!

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:43.960
Flotilla, damage report!

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.340
No damage reported from the flotilla!

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:47.130
Both sides proceed slowly!

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:50.970
The new target is 350 degrees. Speed 60 knots.

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:52.850
It's following the route of target group alpha.

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:54.390
It's chasing the swarm of Manda?

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:54.390
It's getting away at the same speed!

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:19.490
Due to the Manda invasion, the whole
 of Tokyo Bay has been dyed red.

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:19.500
<b>Breaking</b>

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:19.500
<b>News</b>

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:19.500
<b>Outcome of Tokyo Bay's Anti-Manda Operation</b>

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:19.500
