00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:38.810
Expect the unexpected when it comes
 to these mysterious monsters.

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:42.150
Like seeing into the future, for example?

00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:43.570
What are you talking about?

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:46.530
My point is that common sense might not apply to them.

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:48.950
If there are powers beyond our common sense,

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:51.700
shouldn't there also be weaknesses 
beyond our common sense?

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:55.830
"And I say to mankind, Be not curious about God."

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:57.290
Apocalypse?

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:58.660
It's Whitman.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.170
Listen, I met an interesting kid.

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:03.290
You heard about it, right? 
The material of dreams—Archetype.

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:06.800
It's all but a fantasy theory, no?

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:11.430
There might be veins of Archetype somewhere in Japan.

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:16.270
The red tide that's dyed Tokyo Bay...  
I want to know the source of it.

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:19.060
It's the giant creature that's dyeing it red.

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:21.940
And where did they come from? The deep seas?

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:25.570
Could the culprit behind that case
about the missing submarine be...

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:27.230
Rumors, pure and simple.

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.360
Hear me out, Miho-chan!

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:29.780
The name is Yoshiyasu.

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:34.780
Suppose that new dream material 
is a nightmare that destroys the world.

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:39.910
What if the Abyss of Hell 
peeps out from that nightmare?

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:42.670
What are you babbling about?

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:51.590
Okay, pose! From this angle, please.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.990
This is for our PR.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:54.770
It turned out to be a kaiju weak to a harpoon cannon.

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:58.560
Even if it could predict a hit at short distance,

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:00.560
it didn't have time to dodge...

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:03.440
You don't need to capture the whole monster in the photo.

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:01.820
Did you do it!?

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:05.900
It's the people that matters.

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:10.030
The officials and citizens united, and together
they were able to safely defeat the monster.

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:12.950
This moment is going down in history!

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:13.950
Huh?

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:28.590
It was only asphyxiated!

00:18:28.590 --> 00:18:30.050
Let me get another shot in!

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:32.670
I've only got one more with me! Would it work out?

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:34.940
I'm sorry!

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:52.280
It's a wounded kaiju! This situation ain't that good!

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:52.280
Outta my way!

00:18:52.280 --> 00:18:54.320
Die!

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:57.450
I'll finish ya off!

00:18:57.450 --> 00:19:00.370
Take this!

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:06.330
M-My head!

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:19.390
Gramps!

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:20.930
He's unconscious.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:23.600
Yung! Take over the controls and give us a status report.

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:26.480
Roger! Commencing transfer of control.

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:28.980
I am in control.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:31.360
Status report: Head disconnected.

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:32.730
Abnormality in rear gear.

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.240
Purge it.

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:36.180
Roger! Commencing purge.

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:42.520
Purge.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:49.420
Was it asking too much 
to suddenly transfer to two wheels?

