00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:41.390
Let's do this!

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:43.560
Brake!

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:51.100
Shoot!

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:44.200
<i>The government have announced that kaiju such as Rodan and Manda are species separate from existing creatures. </i>

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:53.420
<i>As such, the creatures we call kaiju have the ability to actively rewrite its DNA system.  </i>

00:21:53.420 --> 00:21:56.090
<i>This means there is a high possibility that they are </i>

00:21:56.090 --> 00:22:00.420
<i>hybrid creatures that have inherited 
systems from other, existing creatures. </i>

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:05.010
<i>It is plausible to say that they are 
controlling their evolution by their own will. </i>

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:12.310
<b>I woke up to your voice that painted my vision with color</b>

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:18.190
<b>And it was the same shade of curiosity I find in my familiar daily life</b>

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:23.570
<b>If this feeling can grow naturally on its own</b>

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:29.450
<b>Will it fall off one day like an unripe fruit, I wonder?</b>

00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:34.080
<b>I don't know anything</b>

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:38.460
<b>Not even anything about you</b>

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:46.970
<b>Let me keep on dreaming for now</b>

00:22:46.970 --> 00:22:51.350
<b>If this moment is all I have now</b>

00:22:51.810 --> 00:22:55.810
<b>I can still feel the warmth in my palm</b>

00:22:57.650 --> 00:23:03.070
<b>My thrumming feelings open and burst out</b>

00:23:03.070 --> 00:23:07.080
<b>I want to keep learning more, like I am now</b>

00:23:08.830 --> 00:23:13.620
<b>This pulsating rhythm I feel just won't stop</b>

00:23:13.620 --> 00:23:14.580
<b>It won't stop</b>
